; Rocq proofs about the scheduler, checked by compiling them; none loads the
; plugin. DensityPrefixBound, BudgetAwarePrefixBound and DensityLookahead
; prove that the built-in scorers' prefix bounds are admissible and that
; pruning with them is exact; they model plugin/scheduleRanking.ml and
; plugin/budgetAwareScore.ml, and verification mode checks the premises at
; run time. pruning_bounds, prefix_adapter_laws and dependency_cycle_laws
; model the prefix search, its step conversion and dependency cycles.

(alias
  (name runtest)
  (deps (alias_rec all)))

(coq.theory
  (name QuickChick.TestingProofs)
  (modules DensityPrefixBound BudgetAwarePrefixBound DensityLookahead
           pruning_bounds prefix_adapter_laws dependency_cycle_laws))
